    "description": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This beautifully designed hybrid 1-person sauna is created out of natural Canadian red cedar wood. It is going to delight those looking to warm up and to boost their health in an environment close to nature.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This hybrid sauna features traditional electric heaters that heat the air around you and modern infra-red heaters that penetrate the skin to go deep into the tissue for a range of health benefits. This sauna comfortably seats&nbsp;1 persons and provides the means to relax as well as the means to improve one&rsquo;s health.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>S</span><span>apphire</span>&nbsp;units are well-enclosed in natural wood for extra privacy so that nothing would get into the way of relaxation.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ergonomic design along with a cozy interior makes using this sauna a pleasant experience. The health benefits you receive from sauna usage contribute to the overall feeling of calm and relaxation.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Knowing that being in the sauna is so beneficial for you only enhances the experience.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can choose between a sloped roof and a peaked roof, both variants protect well against the sun, wind, and rain.</span></p>",
